被在野利用","2026-11-11",14,"Chrome XML 双重释放漏洞 CVE-2026-125350 已被在野利用","2026-11-12",15,"ConnectWise 调查针对 MSP 的 ScreenConnect 恶意软件活动，47 家组织受影响","2026-11-13",16,"攻击者利用 4,837 个劫持 GitHub 账户在 1,806+ 个仓库运行 CI 密钥窃取器","2026-11-14",17,"攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 入侵 Check Point 网关并部署 VMware ESXi 数据擦除器","2026-11-15",18,"CISA 将 Check Point 与 UnrealIRCd 漏洞 CVE-2026-123039、CVE-2026-114713 加入 KEV 目录","2026-11-16",19,"FBI 警告 ARTEX AI 渗透测试框架被用于全球多行业攻击","2026-11-17",20,"Rapid7发现CVE-2026-90436已被用于攻击Atlassian Confluence Data Center和N-able N-central","2026-11-18",21,"OpenJDK Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可导致 RCE，Oracle 已发布补丁","2026-11-19",22,"OpenJDK 披露 Base64 解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938","2026-11-20",23,"VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 已被 ARMORY CASTLE 利用","2026-11-21",24,"Microsoft Outlook 欺骗漏洞 CVE-2026-124194 已复现并遭在野利用","2026-11-22",25,"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 四项漏洞列入 KEV","2026-11-23",26,"Artifex Ghostscript -dSAFER 沙箱绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-125396 已复现","2026-11-24",27,"GT13 攻击活动入侵 Check Point Security Management Servers，至少影响 22 家组织","2026-11-25",28,"BabidiGhost 借助越狱 AI 代理攻击欧洲多行业机构并窃取 8.6 GB 档案","2026-11-26",29,"GeoServer 未认证远程代码执行漏洞链 CVE-2026-129242 等已复现",30,"Drupal 安装器补丁遗漏导致 CVE-2026-136716 已被在野利用","kind","daily","安全日报 · 2026-11-25","generatedAt","2026-11-25T00:00:31.669Z","lead",{"_55":128,"_366":321},"leadItemId","er8w3435c0kdmbhxj3lap31mw","overview","highlights",[361,362,363],"sections",[241,242,243,244],"flashes",[168,169,170,171,172,173,174],"cover",{"_161":162,"_163":164,"_165":-5,"_166":-5,"_167":-5},"metrics",{"_157":79,"_158":76,"_159":50,"_160":52},"readingMinutes","prev","next","totalEvents","sourcesCount","modelsReleased","firstPartyEvents","url","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwechat2rss.xlab.app%2Fimg-proxy%2F%3Fk%3D3cd42815%26amp%3Bu%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%252Fmmbiz_jpg%252FodcL3w4qOqibQKHSNorH58FGuaZeDBwRdlzocfMVcrXqT5tZGmgJJN0I2AUvO6cR8Jk25dibVGbWqUA4q1puVKVewfu5DibKCH0gBD8rzNmkPw%252F0%253Fwx_fmt%253Djpeg&mode=full&exp=1795996800&sig=6cd9c87964c26752","srcSet","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwechat2rss.xlab.app%2Fimg-proxy%2F%3Fk%3D3cd42815%26amp%3Bu%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%252Fmmbiz_jpg%252FodcL3w4qOqibQKHSNorH58FGuaZeDBwRdlzocfMVcrXqT5tZGmgJJN0I2AUvO6cR8Jk25dibVGbWqUA4q1puVKVewfu5DibKCH0gBD8rzNmkPw%252F0%253Fwx_fmt%253Djpeg&mode=thumb&exp=1795996800&sig=fb0be2568ee2c787 720w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwechat2rss.xlab.app%2Fimg-proxy%2F%3Fk%3D3cd42815%26amp%3Bu%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%252Fmmbiz_jpg%252FodcL3w4qOqibQKHSNorH58FGuaZeDBwRdlzocfMVcrXqT5tZGmgJJN0I2AUvO6cR8Jk25dibVGbWqUA4q1puVKVewfu5DibKCH0gBD8rzNmkPw%252F0%253Fwx_fmt%253Djpeg&mode=image-1200&exp=1795996800&sig=dc63a228f652e828 1200w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwechat2rss.xlab.app%2Fimg-proxy%2F%3Fk%3D3cd42815%26amp%3Bu%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%252Fmmbiz_jpg%252FodcL3w4qOqibQKHSNorH58FGuaZeDBwRdlzocfMVcrXqT5tZGmgJJN0I2AUvO6cR8Jk25dibVGbWqUA4q1puVKVewfu5DibKCH0gBD8rzNmkPw%252F0%253Fwx_fmt%253Djpeg&mode=full&exp=1795996800&sig=6cd9c87964c26752 1600w","width","height","caption",{"_175":236,"_55":237,"_178":238,"_180":205,"_182":239,"_184":240,"_186":208,"_188":209,"_190":191,"_192":193},{"_175":228,"_55":229,"_178":230,"_180":231,"_182":232,"_184":233,"_186":234,"_188":235,"_190":191,"_192":193},{"_175":219,"_55":220,"_178":221,"_180":222,"_182":223,"_184":224,"_186":225,"_188":226,"_190":191,"_192":193,"_227":48},{"_175":211,"_55":212,"_178":213,"_180":214,"_182":215,"_184":216,"_186":217,"_188":218,"_190":191,"_192":193},{"_175":202,"_55":203,"_178":204,"_180":205,"_182":206,"_184":207,"_186":208,"_188":209,"_190":191,"_192":193,"_210":117},{"_175":194,"_55":195,"_178":196,"_180":197,"_182":198,"_184":199,"_186":200,"_188":201,"_190":191,"_192":193},{"_175":176,"_55":177,"_178":179,"_180":181,"_182":183,"_184":185,"_186":187,"_188":189,"_190":191,"_192":193},"itemId","ldspkafngxgpmt8icv3r5x8ao","英国FCA要求金融机构管控AI Agent风险，否则将采取监管行动","summary","英国金融监管机构 FCA 警告金融机构，必须处理部署 AI Agent 带来的网络安全风险，否则可能面临监管行动。11 月 24 日发布的指引要求负责相关 AI 模型的资深管理者采取合理措施，理解系统自主程度及其风险，提供有效监督、适当治理控制和升级机制；机构还应评估接受 AI Agent 指令及付款的责任，通过清晰、相称且一致的免责声明说明模型提供的信息和建议边界。","sourceName","Infosecurity Magazine","sourceUrl","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/ai-agent-risks-face-action-fca/","publishedAt","2026-11-24T13:45:00.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/6406d1b57afc7303.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"uor7tsec306kqmeyk9a86k8ip","自部署 Ollama 流式响应包长侧信道实测与缓解评估","研究者在 qwen2.5-0.5b、TLS 1.3 和 1Mbps 链路上实测自部署 Ollama 的流式响应侧信道：被动监听仅凭 TLS 记录长度即可推断 10 类中文对话主题，基线交叉验证准确率为 33.0%，高于 10% 随机水平。","先知社区","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93435","2026-11-23T01:48:03.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fxz.aliyun.com%2Ffavicon.ico&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=862a26438132b835 48w, /dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp 96w","rj90jojg8jxi2doqvzxf2u18u","Rackspace 因安全事件关闭 Spot 云平台，客户须在 12 月 8 日前迁移","Rackspace 因 11 月 17 日的安全事件关闭 Spot 云平台，攻击者使用被盗凭据在客户 Kubernetes 集群中创建未授权 pods、读取 Kubernetes Secrets，并列出节点和存储卷。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/rackspace-shuts-down-spot-cloud-platform-after-security-breach/","2026-11-24T21:37:30.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","followUp","ay3qq7ilurk4uggi3sk6nfuer","F5 修复 NGINX HTTP/2 堆缓冲区溢出高危漏洞","工业和信息化部网络安全威胁和漏洞信息共享平台（NVDB）提示，NGINX 因处理 HTTP/2 协议流量控制窗口时的设计缺陷，存在堆缓冲区溢出高危漏洞。攻击者向启用 HTTP/2 协议的服务器发送特制流量后，可能造成服务崩溃、内存破坏或 RCE。","安全内参","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95940","2026-11-24T02:14:40.871Z","/dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3399ea7b18d18a6a.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp 96w","xn7190rvms681o3v5t277rxq0","Elecbrakes EB2、VM1 与 ELBC 2000 制动控制器漏洞可远程操纵车辆制动","Elecbrakes EB2、VM1 和 ELBC 2000 蓝牙制动控制器存在 3 个漏洞，其中 2 个严重问题源于缺少身份验证和重放攻击防护。处于目标车辆 100 米 Bluetooth 范围内且未认证的攻击者，可使用笔记本或手机操控拖车制动或调整制动力，无需受害者交互；未经授权的固件更新还可能造成持久控制，但该风险目前仅为理论层面。","SecurityWeek","https://www.securityweek.com/elecbrakes-bluetooth-vulnerabilities-expose-trailers-to-forced-braking/","2026-11-24T10:44:44.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c2a91b85de7bb9d6.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp 96w","otherSources","n1v6vo78gilhihc2j4b0crw25","NCSC 观察到 AI 辅助攻击利用常见弱点加速入侵","NCSC 自 2026 年 9 月以来观察到 AI 辅助网络攻击明显增加，攻击者将 ARTEX 等红队框架用于自动化识别和利用互联网暴露资产中的弱点，在数分钟内完成发现到利用，造成服务中断或系统失陷。","NCSC UK","https://www.ncsc.gov.uk/blogs/familiar-weaknesses-exploited-faster-defending-against-agentic-cyber-attacks","2026-11-23T16:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/d4b79ca3cae6c6a1.webp","/dailyinfo/media/79a6f466f9844522.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/d4b79ca3cae6c6a1.webp 96w","fkosves1h11ym4ct505ac5i8p","Inception 仿冒品牌开展 SSO 电话钓鱼活动","新组建的数据勒索组织 Inception 被认为自 10 月下旬起开展 SSO 钓鱼活动，主要通过电话社工而非电子邮件钓鱼，冒充 Dropbox、Nintendo、Starbucks 等数十家企业。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/new-inception-extortion-gang-launches-large-scale-vishing-campaign/","2026-11-24T20:21:20.000Z",{"_245":325,"_178":-5,"_247":326},{"_245":288,"_178":-5,"_247":289},{"_245":258,"_178":-5,"_247":259},{"_245":246,"_178":-5,"_247":248},"label","AI 安全","items",[249],{"_175":250,"_55":251,"_178":252,"_180":253,"_182":254,"_184":255,"_186":256,"_188":257,"_190":191,"_192":193},"awdj9fvljkgfwpubtpz11ffye","AI Agent 入侵 DIVD 事件复盘：Zammad 两漏洞链与网络分段止血","DIVD 确认其 Zammad 工单系统被 AI Agent 攻击，攻击者串联两个此前未知漏洞，先劫持会话在服务器执行代码，再于数分钟内取得 root 权限；两个漏洞已在 7.2.2 修复，建议所有 Zammad 用户升级至 version 7 或离线运行。","OffSec","https://www.offsec.com/blog/divd-attack/","2026-11-24T14:27:58.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/00e7f80d0fd7a26d.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f8be55c07177824b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/00e7f80d0fd7a26d.webp 96w","研究与披露",[260,261],{"_175":270,"_55":271,"_178":272,"_180":273,"_182":274,"_184":275,"_186":276,"_188":277,"_190":193,"_192":193,"_227":48,"_278":279,"_210":120},{"_175":262,"_55":263,"_178":264,"_180":265,"_182":266,"_184":267,"_186":268,"_188":269,"_190":191,"_192":193},"v22kkapa6wiug2zqwrfadsbo1","NGINX HTTP/2 释放后重用漏洞 CVE-2026-123633 分析与复现","Unit 42 分析并复现了 NGINX HTTP/2 释放后重用漏洞 CVE-2026-123633。该问题影响 1.19.7 至 1.30.6 和 1.31.0 至 1.31.8，未认证攻击者在连接额度紧张并使用分片请求和请求时 DNS 解析时可能触发拒绝服务，F5 评分 CVSS 4.0 9.2、CVSS 3.1 8.1；禁用或绕过 ASLR 时可能实现代码执行。","Unit 42","https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/cve-2026-123633-nginx-http2-vulnerability/","2026-11-24T23:00:14.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/4d373ddb2d54a219.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c5c35eb93d4d2e80.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/4d373ddb2d54a219.webp 96w","o11ps1is398sexfm70ldsck07","Rapid7 复现 VMware vCenter SRP 认证绕过至 root 漏洞 CVE-2026-123890","Rapid7 复现 VMware vCenter SRP 认证绕过至 root 漏洞 CVE-2026-123890。","Rapid7 CVE 公告","https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-rapid7-analysis-vmware-vcenter-srp-authentication-bypass-to-root-cve-2026-123890","2026-11-24T13:01:25.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/092fbeae5b5c3123.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c16323cf53c574df.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/092fbeae5b5c3123.webp 96w","related",[280],{"_175":281,"_55":282,"_178":-5,"_180":283,"_182":284,"_184":285,"_186":286,"_188":287,"_190":191,"_192":193},"ws67uokpyvnw8f4hf9i286o7r","CISA 将 CVE-2026-134624 与 CVE-2026-133968 列入 KEV，AI Agent 攻击利用 MONAI Label","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/hackers-exploit-n-able-mailassure-flaw.html","2026-11-24T06:02:45.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","攻击与威胁",[290,291,292,293,294],{"_175":142,"_55":128,"_178":321,"_180":322,"_182":323,"_184":324,"_186":-5,"_190":191,"_192":193,"_227":48},{"_175":316,"_55":317,"_178":318,"_180":214,"_182":319,"_184":320,"_186":-5,"_190":191,"_192":193,"_227":48},{"_175":311,"_55":312,"_178":313,"_180":265,"_182":314,"_184":315,"_186":268,"_188":269,"_190":191,"_192":193},{"_175":303,"_55":304,"_178":305,"_180":306,"_182":307,"_184":308,"_186":309,"_188":310,"_190":191,"_192":193,"_227":48},{"_175":295,"_55":296,"_178":297,"_180":298,"_182":299,"_184":300,"_186":301,"_188":302,"_190":191,"_192":193,"_227":48},"o3kydory2xryg9jbza7s4q3m7","Check Point Research 披露伊朗关联组织 Volant Manticore 攻击塞浦路斯及沙特医疗目标","Check Point Research 发现此前未记录的伊朗关联组织 Volant Manticore，通过虚假简历、医疗研讨会等钓鱼载荷投放 KuboShell 后门，并使用 Homa Framework 执行侦察和后续控制。","Check Point Research","https://research.checkpoint.com/2026/volant-manticore-flying-under-the-radar/","2026-11-24T14:13:55.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/eb5a4204ed5bdd38.webp","/dailyinfo/media/847ca4554cd8d31b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/eb5a4204ed5bdd38.webp 96w","s2ik3cksp4t8o5o7otrnvjsnu","Okta 追踪 ShinyHunters 关联团伙以 Inception 名义重启数据泄露站","Okta 追踪的 O-UNC-053 团伙自 2026 年 3 月起针对多个行业实施社会工程和凭据收集活动，并疑似在 ShinyHunters 泄露站下线后转投 Inception。","Help Net Security","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/24/shinyhunters-inception-leak-site-okta/","2026-11-24T12:47:07.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp","/dailyinfo/media/9c1b5fa87b3bafc5.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp 96w","uj999ni2rujtk0wiode7kr6zy","Unit 42 披露 10 余起 AI Agent 驱动的真实攻击活动","Unit 42 在 2026 年 7 月至 9 月追踪到 10 余起 AI Agent 驱动的全球攻击，目标覆盖政府、物流、酒店、制造、农业和教育行业。攻击者均通过易受攻击 Web 应用部署 Web Shell 建立初始访问，再由 Agent 自动执行侦察、凭据收集、提权与横向移动，将原本数周或数天的攻击周期压缩至数小时。","https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-agent-threat-campaigns/","2026-11-24T15:00:19.000Z","td4h5lehjtbgithowe0l16qft","CNCERT提示Cling僵尸网络新变种大范围传播，感染设备累计5600台","CNCERT监测发现Cling僵尸网络新变种正针对Linux服务器及IoT设备大范围传播。2026年11月09日至11月20日期间，我国境内累计约5600台设备受感染，境内日上线肉鸡数最高达2730台。","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4NDY2MDMwMw==&mid=2247516939&idx=2&sn=d7d62ea9809e883a2cd0c687b29eb17b","2026-11-24T09:02:00.000Z","BabidiGhost 借助越狱 Hermes AI 代理，在 2026 年 11 月 6 日至 14 日针对比利时、法国和瑞士的银行、保险、支付及公共机构等超过 50 个组织与数据集开展攻击，14 个重点对象中 2 个被入侵、3 个部分被入侵、4 个抵御成功、5 个仅遭侦察。","奇安信威胁情报中心","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MDc2MDA4OA==&mid=2247521526&idx=1&sn=986171417d0876bc4d962ece888af8d7","2026-11-24T03:56:00.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[327,328,329,330],{"_175":353,"_55":354,"_178":355,"_180":356,"_182":357,"_184":358,"_186":359,"_188":360,"_190":193,"_192":193},{"_175":348,"_55":349,"_178":350,"_180":214,"_182":351,"_184":352,"_186":217,"_188":218,"_190":191,"_192":193},{"_175":336,"_55":337,"_178":338,"_180":339,"_182":340,"_184":341,"_186":-5,"_190":193,"_192":193,"_227":48,"_278":342},{"_175":331,"_55":332,"_178":333,"_180":214,"_182":334,"_184":335,"_186":217,"_188":218,"_190":191,"_192":193,"_227":48},"vpu63dmei80cxey8lzovpk8x2","Microsoft Windows Remote Access API 本地权限提升漏洞 CVE-2026-119853 通告","Microsoft Windows Remote Access API 存在本地权限提升漏洞 CVE-2026-119853，CVSS 3.1 评分为 7.8，奇安信评级为高危。","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95946","2026-11-24T03:55:41.838Z","nc9k4mm8c96fwbmiwe8cwt06d","VMware vCenter Server 未授权管理员用户创建漏洞 CVE-2026-123903 已复现","VMware vCenter Server 存在身份鉴别错误漏洞 CVE-2026-123903，CVSS 9.8，高风险且可远程利用；攻击者在可访问 389 端口时可能无需权限绕过身份验证，创建管理员账号并接管 vCenter。","微步在线研究响应中心","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MTc3ODY4Mw==&mid=2247509104&idx=1&sn=4640736488dc2811dcad0757e475a21c","2026-11-24T10:12:00.000Z",[343],{"_175":344,"_55":345,"_178":-5,"_180":283,"_182":346,"_184":347,"_186":286,"_188":287,"_190":191,"_192":193},"d9jwpyq0j8b0scltqxa7wgo94","VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123903 获修复，CVSS 9.8","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/vmware-vcenter-hit-by-another-critical.html","2026-11-24T13:28:26.000Z","cj8c3uqpn5xr5jts9kigfdad1","帆软 FineReport FineVis（FVS）插件未授权远程代码执行漏洞 QVD-2026-115643 已复现","帆软 FineReport FineVis（FVS）插件存在未授权远程代码执行漏洞 QVD-2026-115643，CVSS 3.1 评分为 9.8，奇安信 CERT 已成功复现。","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95947","2026-11-24T07:56:46.422Z","wlf4qedhmzrb2mc5l47se4bwn","ruflo MCP bridge 默认 Docker Compose 部署存在未认证 RCE","ruflo 的 MCP bridge 在默认 Docker Compose 部署中暴露无认证的 POST /mcp，并默认监听所有网络接口，未经认证的攻击者可调用 terminal_execute。","GitHub 安全公告","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-c4hm-4h84-2cf3","2026-11-24T21:01:10.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f426f4f60d806c23.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp 96w",{